<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australis yr net loss A$251.69 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australis yr net loss A$251.69 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		     loss 220.98 vs loss 122.05</p>
<p>    Net			     loss 251.69 vs loss 122.05</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		nil vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Australis Media Ltd is a pay TV operator.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)		  nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Sales				     52.19 vs 4.60</p>
<p>    Other income			    14.15 vs 8.63</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			 loss 44.5 vs loss 23.5</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		   loss 30.71 vs nil</p>
<p>    Tax					   nil vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest				  39.79 vs 4.93</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    57.67 vs 6.29</p>
<p>Note: Australis said the abnormal loss was due to business restructuring costs.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
